              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भनक — bhanak — \"an inkling; a whisper (of news)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुझे उसकी योजना की भनक लग गई। Mujhe uskī yojnā kī bhanak lag gaī. I got wind of his plan."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भनक (bhanak) is a tadbhava, inherited from bhan, \"hum, buzz\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 9382). CDIAL gives the Hindi word only as \"hum, buzz\"; the sense \"an inkling\", news that reaches you as a faint buzz, is a later Hindi use CDIAL does not give."
            }
          ]
        },
